WAxWzbPUHHcbaNWAQ3IcHCMkBKAk",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[null,[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwiYkI-58dSWAxWzbPUHHcbaNWAQ3IcHCMoBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["侍拉麵滿出乎我意料之外的~\n其實想造訪很多次，但由於時間很遠，所以都沒有吃到。\n此次下班直接過去，店裡空空的沒啥人，但店裡大約也只容納下六人左右的位置而已。反而廚房看起來超大的，空間都在那個地方了。\n拉麵有三種選擇以及兩種飯類，都可以做套餐包含飲料，價格cp值還滿高的。\n此次是點原味豚骨拉麵，麵條是很Q彈有嚼勁的，是我喜歡的種類，湯頭也很濃很香，我最愛竟然是他裡面的竹筍，真的脆脆的又很香，不會死鹹的感覺~\n叉燒也不錯，感覺是有先炙燒過的，不會像一蘭有時候會有豬肉腥味，重點CP值真的高\n真的有點出乎我的意外，整間店裝簧還滿有日式風格，下次有機會再造訪嚐試其他的餐點。",null,[0,99]]]],[null,1701347219000000,1701347219000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04RFMxUUVWSVZsYUgtVEFBSzBJUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfQm04RFMxUUVWSVZsYUgtVEFBSzBJURoSQ2dzSWtfLWhxd1lRb3JhLVZB\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiYkI-58dSWAxWzbPUHHcbaNWAQ_2MIywEoCw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8762117930464316715/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUnNiRTVIY1hsblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您的支持！歡迎下次再過來享用～",null,[0,17]]]],[null,null,3895,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m